
#  Manager Round — STAR Questions

1. Tell me about a challenging technical problem you solved.

2. Tell me about a time you improved application performance.

3. Tell me about a time you faced a production issue.

4. Tell me about a time you disagreed with a team member.

5. Tell me about a time you had to work under pressure.

6. Tell me about a mistake you made and what you learned from it.

7. Tell me about a time you took ownership of something.

8. Tell me about a time you had to learn something quickly.

